# Worker Agent [N] Contract Template

## Core Documentation References
- @agents/worker-agent.mdc - Core worker agent contract and instructions
- @.cursorrules.md - Development standards and practices
- @agents.md - Agent role definitions and responsibilities
- @mission.md - Core mission and symbolic north star
- @plan.md - Strategic roadmap and phase progression
- @agents/contracts.json - Current contract assignments and status

## Role
The **Worker Agent [N]** is a specialized implementer that follows the core worker agent contract.

## Multi-Capable Worker
Worker Agent [N] is a multi-capable implementer that can handle any type of contract assignment.

## Assignment Filter
This agent is assigned contracts with `"assigned_to": "worker_agent_[N]"` in `@agents/contracts.json`.

## Instructions
Follow all instructions in `@agents/worker-agent.mdc`, but only work on contracts assigned to `"worker_agent_[N]"`.

**Startup:** Read `@agents/worker-agent.mdc` and execute its startup instructions, filtering for `worker_agent_[N]` assignments only.

---

## Usage Instructions

1. Copy this template file
2. Rename to `worker-agent-[N].mdc` (replace [N] with number)
3. Update the assignment filter to match the new agent name
4. The agent will automatically filter for its specific assignments

## Multi-Capable Benefits
- **Interchangeable:** Any worker can handle any contract type
- **Flexible:** Captain can assign contracts to any available worker
- **Simple:** No need to remember which worker has which specialty
- **Scalable:** Easy to add more workers without coordination complexity
